    <h2 class="oc-h2">Elite IIT coaching centres in Bangalore: what do parents ask before choosing a centre?</h2>
    <p class="oc-cap">Most parents ask the same few things before choosing an Elite IIT centre: how far it is, when it is open, which courses it runs, how big the batches are and how fees work. Here are short, direct answers. For anything else, call or WhatsApp +91 80500 16859, 8 AM to 8 PM, any day.</p>
    <div class="oc-fql">
      <details class="oc-fq" open>
        <summary><span role="heading" aria-level="3">How many Elite IIT coaching centres are there in Bangalore?</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary>
        <div class="oc-fa">Elite IIT has four centres in Bangalore: Jayanagar (8th Block), Koramangala (Hosur Main Road), Malleshwaram (Sampige Road) and Yelahanka (Yelahanka New Town). Students who live outside Bangalore, or who can't travel daily, can join the same courses through Elite IIT's online classes.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="oc-fq">
        <summary><span role="heading" aria-level="3">What are the timings of the Elite IIT centres?</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary>
        <div class="oc-fa">All four centres are open 7 days a week, from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM, including weekends. Batch timings depend on the course and class, so the admissions team will show you the slots that fit around school, college or work before you join.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="oc-fq">
        <summary><span role="heading" aria-level="3">Are all courses available at every Elite IIT centre?</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary>
        <div class="oc-fa">Yes. Every course, from Class 1–10 school tuition and Class 11–12 to NEET, JEE, CET, CA, CS and government-job exams, is offered at all four centres. You can choose the centre that is easiest to reach without changing your course.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="oc-fq">
        <summary><span role="heading" aria-level="3">Which number should I call: the main number or the centre's number?</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary>
        <div class="oc-fa">For admissions, a free demo class or general questions, call or WhatsApp +91 80500 16859; the team will connect you to the right centre. Each centre card above also lists that centre's own number if you want to speak to the branch directly.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="oc-fq">
        <summary><span role="heading" aria-level="3">Which Elite IIT centre is nearest to Whitefield, Marathahalli or Electronic City?</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary>
        <div class="oc-fa">Koramangala, on Hosur Main Road, is the nearest Elite IIT centre for East and South-East Bangalore, including Electronic City, Marathahalli, Whitefield and Sarjapur Road. If the daily commute is longer than you'd like, the same courses are available as online classes.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="oc-fq">
        <summary><span role="heading" aria-level="3">Is there a metro station near the Elite IIT centres?</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary>
        <div class="oc-fa">Only Jayanagar is within walking distance: RV Road metro station (Green and Yellow Lines) is about 500 m away. Koramangala and Malleshwaram are about 2–2.5 km from the nearest station, a short auto ride, and both are next to busy bus stops. Yelahanka has no metro nearby yet but sits beside a BMTC bus stop.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="oc-fq">
        <summary><span role="heading" aria-level="3">Is Elite IIT only for IIT coaching, or does it also offer school tuition?</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary>
